Setup       cloud_disk

### Disk parameters

Sigma0          310.547                 Surface Density at R0 (=5.2AU in CGS unit system)
Alpha           1.0e-3                  Uniform kinematic viscosity
SigmaSlope      1.5                     Slope of surface
Rin             0.0                     Inner radius of exponential cutoff (0 disables inner cutoff)
Rout            4.488e+14               Outer radius of exponential cutoff
RhoFloorGas     1.0e-21                 Floor density (gas)
RhoFloorDust    1.0e-21                 Floor density (dust)
AspectRatio     0.03799                 Aspect ratio at R0 (sets temperature at R0)
FlaringIndex    0.25                    Flaring index (sets the slope of the temperature, 0.25 = passive irradiation)

### Cloudlet parameters

ImpactParameter   0.5               Impact parameter in terms of the critical impact parameter
CloudletRadius    7.47989355e+15    Radius of cloudlet
CloudletMass      1.053e+31       Mass of cloudlet
Prograde          1                 Trajectory is prograde for 1 and retrograde for 0
RotAngleX         45.0               Rotation angle around x-axis
RotAngleY         0.0               Rotation angle around y-axis
RotAxFirst        0                 Determines around which axis the trajectory is rotated first: 0 is x-axis and 1 is y-axis

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig        planets/zero.cfg    Choice of planet config (zero.cfg puts an invisbile massless planet)
Inclination         1.0471975511965976

### Mesh parameters

Nx        100                         Azimuthal number of zones 
Ny        150                         Radial number of zones
Nz        175                        Number of zones in colatitude

### Output control parameters

OutputDir     @outputs/cloud_disk_it450_Rout30_correct_rotX45          Output directory
Ntot          90000                                    Total number of time steps
